  "notes": "PrimeVue 4.5.5 (last MIT release; 5.x requires a PrimeUI license key and renders an 'Invalid PrimeUI License' banner without one) with the official @primeuix/themes Aura preset in styled mode, darkModeSelector '.dark' driven by ?theme=. Icons default to PrimeIcons (native); ?icons=lucide|tabler|phosphor|heroicons (alias ?icon=) switch to lucide-vue-next / @tabler/icons-vue / @phosphor-icons/vue / @heroicons/vue via src/icons. Fonts: library default is the system font stack; ?font= switches self-hosted OFL fonts. Charts use PrimeVue Chart backed by chart.js; Markdown via marked. QRCode, Watermark and Tour have no PrimeVue equivalent and are marked missing (placeholders rendered)."
